    "pattern": "Topological sort (Kahn's algorithm)",
    "summary": "Turn each neighboring pair's first differing letters into an arrow, then repeatedly take the smallest letter with no incoming arrows. Leftover letters mean a cycle; a word before its own prefix means no order.",
    "timeComplexity": "O(C + U log U)",
    "spaceComplexity": "O(U²)",
    "whenToUse": [
      "An ordering hidden in pairwise comparisons",
